      "content": "The pain of being erased is a heavy burden to carry, but it's a temporary state of being that can be overcome with time and self-compassion. Remember that your worth isn't defined by your job title or the opinions of others, but by the unique person you are inside. It's okay to take things one step at a time, even if the foundation feels shaky right now.",
